Karen Lagerman is the mother of [[People/Tommy Lagerman|Tommy Lagerman]], in [[Geography/Calaria/Wrenford|Wrenford]]. Tommy says she will not tell him what she does, but that he has seen her writing a lot on a typewriter, and that he thinks she works for a newspaper. He says she told him the [[Green Father|Green Man]] is not real.

She says she does not write for a newspaper and works as a law clerk for a local legal office. [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Cedric Corot|Cedric Corot]] could tell she was lying.
